meta {
  name: Get Ledger by Date
  type: http
  seq: 7
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/home/ledger/2026-01-27
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{authToken}}
}

docs {
  ## Get Ledger by Date
  
  Mendapatkan daily ledger berdasarkan tanggal (format: YYYY-MM-DD).
  
  ### URL Parameters:
  - `date` (string): Tanggal dalam format YYYY-MM-DD
  
  ### Response:
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "date": "2026-01-27",
      "totalCalories": 2000,
      "totalProtein": 100,
      "activities": [...]
    }
  }
  ```
}
